# Sprite Foundry server configuration — copy to .env (never commit .env)
#
# Server-side OpenAI provider (strongest path: gpt-image-1 with transparent
# background, edits, inpainting, multi-reference in-betweening).
# The key stays server-side and is never returned to the page.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
#
# Change the port if needed (default 4173)
# PORT=4173
